sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Developer
    participant CI as CI
    participant G as Env repo
    participant R as Reconciler
    participant A as Admission
    participant P as Progressive delivery
    D->>CI: merge to main
    CI->>CI: hermetic build, test once, one immutable image
    CI->>CI: push by digest, sign, attach provenance and SBOM
    CI->>G: promotion commit — image: repo@sha256:abc
    Note over CI,G: CI proposes. It holds no cluster credentials.
    R->>G: pull desired state
    R->>A: apply the difference
    A->>A: signed? no :latest? limits set?
    alt policy violated
        A-->>R: refused — the backstop that does not trust the pipeline
    else admitted
        A->>P: roll out
        loop 5% then 25% then 50% then 100%
            P->>P: shift traffic, then bake
            P->>P: compare against previous version, same slice
            alt gate fails or signal missing
                P->>P: halt, revert this stage — old pods still running
            end
        end
    end
    Note over G,R: rollback is a git revert plus reconcile, and needs no rebuild
